      "worked": "In one-variable statistics, enter $3,4,5,6,7,8$ in $x$ and $3,7,5,1,0,4$ in Freq. The mean result is $\\bar{x}=5$.\n\nCheck using the frequency totals:\n\n$$\\begin{align*}\\sum f&=3+7+5+1+0+4\\\\\\sum f&=20\\\\\\sum xf&=3\\times3+4\\times7+5\\times5+6\\times1+7\\times0+8\\times4\\\\\\sum xf&=100\\\\\\bar{x}&=\\frac{\\sum xf}{\\sum f}\\\\\\bar{x}&=\\frac{100}{20}\\\\\\bar{x}&=5\\end{align*}$$\n\nThe mean is $5$ goals per game.",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
    },
